  "body": "<!-- ⚠️ If you do not respect this template, your issue will be closed -->\r\n<!-- ⚠️ Make sure to browse the opened and closed issues to confirm this idea does not exist. -->\r\n\r\n### What is the expected enhancement?\r\n\r\nTerra has just added support for Dict-based `aux_operators` in its `Eigensolver` interfaces (https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-terra/pull/6870). This can greatly improve the handling within the property framework.",
